a follow-up to my post on simple whetstones:
* blessed whetstones could remove the curse from, but not bestow a
blessing upon a weapon.
* applying an uncursed or blessed whetstone to an axe upgrades it to
an axe named Cleaver.
----------------------------------------
an item (tool) that i'd like to see in the game is earplugs:
* uncursed earplugs make you go deaf. you can't hear sound messages like the
chime of a cash register or the splashing of a naiad. in addition, while
wearing them you couldn't hear hissing sounds, use your stethoscope or
be a musical mastermind.
* cursed earplugs can't be removed and usually have a substance on them which
can occasionally poison you or make you hallucinate. in rare cases you
would be infected, thus making you sick (enough to die eventually).
* blessed earplugs merely make you tone-deaf so that you can't hear the
hissing sounds of certain monsters. you could still be a musical mastermind,
you could use your stethoscope and you could hear sound messages.

